---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Trend Oracle — Enterprise"
  description="Private beta: know what Gen Z is obsessed with 4–12 weeks before it goes mainstream. TrendOracle by Mad River AI."
  ogTitle="Trend Oracle"
  ogSubtitle="Private Beta"
  ogEyebrow="Enterprise"
>
  <main class="enterprise-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">ENTERPRISE — PRIVATE BETA</div>
      <h1>
        <span class="accent">We knew it was coming.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        TrendOracle identifies emerging social media trends 4–12 weeks before they reach
        mainstream awareness — with dated, auditable predictions.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="mailto:hello@madriverai.com?subject=TrendOracle%20Beta" class="btn-primary">
          Request Beta Access
        </a>
        <span class="beta-note">Limited to 10 design partners. Currently 6 spots remaining.</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="proof">
      <h2>The Track Record</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Every prediction is timestamped the moment it's made. Outcomes are recorded when trends hit
        mainstream. No retroactive claims. No survivorship bias.
      </p>
      <p class="track-record-note">
        Each prediction is hashed and anchored to the Bitcoin blockchain through
        <a href="https://opentimestamps.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenTimestamps</a>.
        Clients receive the prediction and its proof file, and can verify the date themselves
        with the open-source <code>ots</code> tool — no need to trust us.
        Predictions are shared with clients only, not published.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="signals">
      <h2>What We Track</h2>
      <div class="signal-grid">
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-icon">🎵</div>
          <h3>TikTok Sound Velocity</h3>
          <p>Sound adoption precedes hashtag trending by 48–96 hours. We track sounds the moment micro-creators pick them up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-icon">🕸</div>
          <h3>Cross-Platform Coherence</h3>
          <p>The same signal appearing independently on TikTok, Reddit, and Instagram within 72 hours = organic. One platform only = manufactured or noise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-icon">🔁</div>
          <h3>Small→Large Subreddit Flow</h3>
          <p>Content appears in niche subreddits 2–8 weeks before mainstream spillover. We track the feeder communities that are consistently first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Instagram Location Clusters</h3>
          <p>When 3+ early-adopter accounts start tagging the same restaurant or spot before any mega-account notices — that's a spot trend in its first week.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tiers">
      <h2>Enterprise Tiers</h2>
      <div class="tier-grid">
        <div class="tier-card">
          <div class="tier-name">Professional</div>
          <div class="tier-price">$999<span>/mo</span></div>
          <ul>
            <li>TrendOracle access</li>
            <li>100k API calls/mo</li>
            <li>Weekly signal digest</li>
            <li>Email alerts on high-confidence signals (>0.7)</li>
            <li>All 4 platforms: Twitter, Reddit, Instagram, TikTok</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="mailto:hello@madriverai.com?subject=TrendOracle%20Professional" class="btn-tier">
            Apply for Beta
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="tier-card featured">
          <div class="tier-badge">MOST REQUESTED</div>
          <div class="tier-name">Enterprise</div>
          <div class="tier-price">Custom</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Everything in Professional</li>
            <li>Dedicated instance</li>
            <li>Custom keyword watchlists</li>
            <li>Raw signal data access</li>
            <li>SLA + dedicated support</li>
            <li>Quarterly accuracy review</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="mailto:hello@madriverai.com?subject=TrendOracle%20Enterprise" class="btn-tier">
            Talk to Us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="use-cases">
      <h2>Who Uses TrendOracle</h2>
      <div class="usecase-grid">
        <div class="usecase">
          <h3>Marketing Agencies</h3>
          <p>Brief clients on what's coming, not what's already trending. 8 weeks of lead time changes campaign planning entirely.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="usecase">
          <h3>Influencer Management</h3>
          <p>Know which sounds, aesthetics, and challenges to position your creators for before they peak. Be first, not fast-follower.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="usecase">
          <h3>Media & Publishing</h3>
          <p>Assign the story before the trend goes mainstream. Source content from the micro-creators who started it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="usecase">
          <h3>Consumer Brands</h3>
          <p>Product launches and campaigns timed to trend cycles rather than reacting to them after the fact.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-bottom">
      <h2>Join the Beta</h2>
      <p>10 design partner slots. We work closely with beta clients to validate predictions against their specific use cases.</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@madriverai.com?subject=TrendOracle%20Beta%20Interest" class="btn-primary">
        hello@madriverai.com
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .enterprise-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 80px 0 60px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .accent { color: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff); }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #a0aec0;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    background: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    color: #020714;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  .beta-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #718096;
  }

  section {
    padding: 60px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .section-sub {
    color: #a0aec0;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .prediction-sample {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .pred-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .pred-card.pending { border-color: rgba(0,229,255,0.3); }
  .pred-card.placeholder { opacity: 0.5; }

  .pred-status {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .pred-keyword {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    text-transform: lowercase;
  }

  .pred-date, .pred-eta, .pred-conf {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #718096;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .track-record-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #718096;
  }

  .track-record-note a { color: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff); }

  .signal-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .signal-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .signal-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .signal-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .signal-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #a0aec0; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }

  .tier-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .tier-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .tier-card.featured {
    border-color: rgba(0,229,255,0.4);
    background: rgba(0,229,255,0.04);
  }

  .tier-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    color: #020714;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .tier-name {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .tier-price {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .tier-price span { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 400; color: #718096; }

  .tier-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .tier-card li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #a0aec0;
    padding: 6px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }

  .tier-card li::before {
    content: "✓ ";
    color: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .btn-tier {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    color: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }

  .btn-tier:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
    color: #020714;
  }

  .usecase-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .usecase h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: var(--color-accent, #00e5ff);
  }

  .usecase p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #a0aec0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .cta-bottom {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-bottom p {
    color: #a0aec0;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }
</style>
